WEBVTT

00:00:28.693 --> 00:00:30.465
Patrick

00:00:30.465 --> 00:00:32.760
Patrick alizaliwa Liberia

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.770
kwa familia ya watoto ishirini

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:40.091
Wakati wa vita vya wenyewe kwa wenyewe,
yeye na familia yake walilazimika

00:00:40.091 --> 00:00:42.263
kukimbilia Nigeria.

00:00:42.263 --> 00:00:45.230
huko licha ya hali yake,

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.384
alihitimu sekondari kwa
karibu alama kamili.

00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:52.040
Alitaka kuendelea na elimu ya juu

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.840
lakini kutokana na familia yake

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.672
kuishi katika mstari wa umaskini

00:00:55.672 --> 00:00:57.944
haikuchukua mda, akatumwa Afrika Kusini

00:00:57.944 --> 00:01:00.144
kufanya kazi na kutuma fedha nyumbani